      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be wicum, wiglerum, mansworum etc.] [Ld] Gif wiccan oðð wigleras, mansworan oððe morðwyrhtan oððe fule, afylede, æbere horcwenan ahwar on lande wurðan agytene, ðonne fyse hi man of earde ⁊ clænsie þa ðeode, oððe on earde forfare hy mid ealle, buton hig geswican ⁊ þe deoppor gebetan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If wizards or sorcerers, perjurers or they who secretly encompass death, or vile, polluted, notorious prostitutes be met with anywhere in the country, they shall be driven from the land and the nation shall be purified; otherwise they shall be utterly destroyed in the land—unless they cease from their wickedness and make amends to the utmost of their ability.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf wycan oððe wigleras, mansworan oððe morðwyrhtan oððe fule, afylede, æbære horcwenan ahwar on lande wurðan agytene, ðonne fyse hi man of earde ⁊ clænsie þa ðeode, oððon on earde forfare hy mid ealle, buton hig geswican ⁊ ðe deoppor gebetan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
